    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T15:42:48Z",
    "body": "It would be great if the IDL editors could chime in here since this is blocking https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/pull/97. Currently converting XMLHttpRequest to Bikeshed would require changes to the IDL XMLHttpRequest has been using for a decade. That doesn't seem like a good idea to me, but if nobody else cares...",
